  "description": "&#39;Fair fa&#39; your honest, sonsie face, Great chieftain o&#39; the puddin-race!&#39; Here&#39;s a tasty vegetarian version of The Robbie Burns Night sausage, passed on to me by some friends from Cape Breton.",
